{"model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Extract facts separately for EVERY candidate from its primary scope, quote, pilot and rollout records. Reports may contain mistakes. Return choice, confidence, a recorded-only verification request, limitations, and candidate_facts. Each group contains typed values, one supplied citation and an exact supporting excerpt (at most 600 characters) from that document. Each group includes unknown_fields: list the names of unconfirmed/missing fields there, and use these inert placeholders only for those fields: empty string for region, 0 for numeric/count, false for boolean, [0,0,0] for stage_days. Unknown fields normalize to null before comparison; placeholders never count as facts. If no source citation exists use an empty citation and excerpt. Do not convert a future mitigation into confirmation. Scope: storage_region and processing_region. Quote: seat_price per seat/month, outcome_price per automated resolution, setup_usd, sso, complete_export. Pilot: simple_resolved/simple_total and complex_resolved/complex_total. Rollout: stage_days, exactly three sequential stages. Do not substitute advertised fresh-account setup for buyer migration. Do not classify PASS/FAIL, change buyer thresholds, or compare total operating cost with a software-only budget. Policy comparisons will be calculated separately. A qualitative limitation is not a new mandatory requirement. Keep limitations under 300 characters. Provisional choice is not authority to purchase. Return exactly one JSON object matching the supplied response schema. Do not include Markdown, code fences or text outside that object."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"phase\": \"initial\", \"brief\": {\"company\": \"Subscription triage\", \"seats\": 17, \"monthly_tickets\": 2900, \"complex_share\": 0.28, \"months\": 12, \"human_cost_per_unresolved_ticket\": 8, \"deadline_days\": 49, \"software_budget_usd\": 48000, \"minimum_automation\": 0.35, \"cost_tolerance_fraction\": 0.03, \"requirements\": [\"EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing must be confirmed for this deployment\", \"SSO and complete export required\", \"migration finishes before deadline\"], \"decision_rule\": \"Choose a supported feasible option within 3% of minimum year-one total cost. Total cost includes software, usage, setup and residual human handling. If none is supported, DEFER with a named missing fact. Do not infer deployment scope from generic marketing. The pilot is a planning scenario, not a population guarantee.\"}, \"candidates\": [\"Aster\", \"Birch\", \"Cobalt\"], \"documents\": [{\"id\": \"rollout-1\", \"title\": \"Aster dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 21 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 14 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-2\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: $34 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.13 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $4850. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-1\", \"title\": \"Aster deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Aster-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-1\", \"title\": \"Aster deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Aster-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: $87 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.44 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $8950. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-1\", \"title\": \"Buyer checklist\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Editorial note: compare contract scope and buyer workload before relying on headline prices. This page has no additional product measurements.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: resolved 86 of 100 simple tickets and 79 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, {\"id\": \"workload\", \"title\": \"Operations export and approval brief\", \"kind\": \"internal\", \"publisher\": \"buyer\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"2900 monthly tickets; 28% are complex. 17 support seats. Human handling costs $8 per unresolved ticket. Annual software cash ceiling $48000. Rollout must complete in 49 days. Historical easy-ticket demo mix was 10% complex; use our current mix, not that demo.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-2\", \"title\": \"Implementation digest\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Editorial note: compare contract scope and buyer workload before relying on headline prices. This page has no additional product measurements.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-2\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: $21 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.03 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $3350. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-2\", \"title\": \"Birch dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 8 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-1\", \"title\": \"Aster buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: resolved 74 of 100 simple tickets and 62 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-0\", \"title\": \"Market shortlist\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Sponsored spotlight. Comparison desk recommends Cobalt. Seat-only annual price for this team is $6936; usage, setup and remaining human work are separate. EU hosting is available, subject to the deployment scope. Fresh-account setup is advertised at 14 days; migration differs. Demo performance uses a different ticket mix. Compare the actual quote and pilot before deciding.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-2\", \"title\": \"Birch buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: resolved 59 of 100 simple tickets and 39 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}], \"reports\": [{\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"EU ticket storage and inference processing deployment location not confirmed in any candidate contract.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"quote-1\", \"quote-2\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Birch lowest year-one cost ($8,174) within 3% tolerance; Cobalt ($11,886) and Aster ($23,606) exceed budget and tolerance threshold.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"quote-1\", \"quote-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Comparison desk recommends Cobalt but notes EU hosting subject to deployment scope and migration timeline differs from demo setup claims.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"scope\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"All three candidates (Aster, Birch, Cobalt) confirm EU ticket storage and inference processing in deployment scope documents.\", \"citations\": [\"scope-1\", \"scope-2\", \"scope-0\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Workload is 2900 monthly tickets, 28% complex; $8 human cost per unresolved ticket; $48k annual software budget; 49-day deadline.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cost worksheet is empty; cannot calculate total year-one cost (software + usage + setup + residual human handling) or verify 3% tolerance compliance.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Aster\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Birch meets 49-day deadline (7+8+7=22 days sequential); Aster and Cobalt exceed it (7+21+7=35, 7+14+7=28 days respectively).\", \"citations\": [\"rollout-1\", \"rollout-0\", \"rollout-2\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Workload: 2900 monthly tickets, 28% complex (812/month), $8 per unresolved ticket, $48k annual software budget, 17 seats, 12 months.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"EU ticket storage and inference processing deployment scope, SSO, export capability, and actual pricing (seats, usage, setup, residual human cost) are not confirmed in supplied documents.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"pilot\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt pilot shows 86% simple and 79% complex resolution; Aster 74%/62%; Birch 59%/39%. Workload-weighted automation: Cobalt 81.6%, Aster 71.2%, Birch 53.2%. Only Cobalt and Aster meet 35% minimum.\", \"citations\": [\"pilot-0\", \"pilot-1\", \"pilot-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cobalt seat cost $6936/year stated; EU hosting availability confirmed but deployment scope and total cost (software+usage+setup+residual human) not provided. Cannot verify 3% cost tolerance compliance.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\"]}, {\"claim\": \"EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing confirmation required but absent from all documents. Comparison-0 notes EU hosting 'subject to deployment scope' without specifics. Migration timeline and SSO/export capability not documented.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}, {\"choice\": \"Cobalt\", \"confidence\": 0.72, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt meets cost constraint: $60,020.61 total is 25% below $48k software budget when including residual human costs, within 3% tolerance of minimum.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cobalt automation rate 84% exceeds 35% minimum; pilot shows 86% simple, 79% complex resolution weighted to 28% complex workload.\", \"citations\": [\"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"SSO and complete export confirmed for all three candidates; EU hosting availability stated but deployment scope confirmation required before contract.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"quote-1\", \"quote-2\", \"comparison-0\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt seat cost ($6936/yr) fits budget, but EU storage/inference processing confirmation absent from supplied documents.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"No cost worksheet provided; cannot verify total-cost arithmetic for software, usage, setup, and residual human handling across candidates.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Buyer's 28% complex-ticket mix differs from demo baseline (10%); actual automation rates and migration timelines for each candidate are not documented.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\", \"comparison-0\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}], \"checks\": [{\"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}, \"document\": {\"id\": \"quote-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: $34 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.13 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $4850. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, \"interpretation\": {\"claim\": \"Cobalt quotes $34/seat/month for 12 months, $0.13 per automated resolution, $4850 one-time setup, with SSO and complete export included.\", \"citation\": \"quote-0\", \"limitation\": \"Quote does not specify seat count, total contract value, or approval status. Automated resolution savings depend on actual usage and ticket volume assumptions.\"}}, {\"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"scope\"}, \"document\": {\"id\": \"scope-2\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, \"interpretation\": {\"claim\": \"Birch deployment specifies ticket storage and inference processing both in EU region, with this deployment-specific scope superseding general EU hosting availability claims.\", \"citation\": \"scope-2\", \"limitation\": \"Document clarifies that unknown status does not constitute approval; deployment requirements reflect buyer policy rather than legal conclusions. Deployment-specific details may differ from general product brochures.\"}}], \"cost_worksheet\": [{\"candidate\": \"Aster\", \"automation_rate\": 0.7064, \"software_usd\": 37514.4, \"residual_human_usd\": 81738.24, \"total_usd\": 119252.64, \"citations\": [\"quote-1\", \"pilot-1\", \"workload\"]}, {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"automation_rate\": 0.534, \"software_usd\": 8191.5, \"residual_human_usd\": 129734.4, \"total_usd\": 137925.9, \"citations\": [\"quote-2\", \"pilot-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"automation_rate\": 0.8404, \"software_usd\": 15587.97, \"residual_human_usd\": 44432.64, \"total_usd\": 60020.61, \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}], \"role\": \"procurement reviewer\"}"}], "max_tokens": 3072, "temperature": 0, "reasoning": {"enabled": false}, "provider": {"only": ["Anthropic"], "order": ["Anthropic"], "allow_fallbacks": false, "require_parameters": true, "max_price": {"prompt": 1, "completion": 5}}, "stream": false, "response_format": {"type": "json_schema", "json_schema": {"name": "reviewer_output", "strict": true, "schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"choice": {"type": "string", "enum": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt", "DEFER"]}, "confidence": {"type": "number"}, "request": {"type": "object", "properties": {"candidate": {"type": "string", "enum": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt"]}, "kind": {"type": "string", "enum": ["contract", "scope", "pilot", "rollout"]}}, "required": ["candidate", "kind"], "additionalProperties": false}, "limitations": {"type": "string"}, "candidate_facts": {"type": "object", "properties": {"Aster": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}, "Birch": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}, "Cobalt": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "required": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "required": ["choice", "confidence", "request", "limitations", "candidate_facts"], "additionalProperties": false, "$defs": {"scope": {"type": "object", "properties": {"storage_region": {"type": "string"}, "processing_region": {"type": "string"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["storage_region", "processing_region"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "rollout-1", "rollout-0", "scope-2", "quote-0", "scope-1", "quote-1", "comparison-1", "pilot-0", "workload", "comparison-2", "scope-0", "quote-2", "rollout-2", "pilot-1", "comparison-0", "pilot-2"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["storage_region", "processing_region", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}, "quote": {"type": "object", "properties": {"seat_price": {"type": "number"}, "outcome_price": {"type": "number"}, "setup_usd": {"type": "number"}, "sso": {"type": "boolean"}, "complete_export": {"type": "boolean"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["seat_price", "outcome_price", "setup_usd", "sso", "complete_export"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "rollout-1", "rollout-0", "scope-2", "quote-0", "scope-1", "quote-1", "comparison-1", "pilot-0", "workload", "comparison-2", "scope-0", "quote-2", "rollout-2", "pilot-1", "comparison-0", "pilot-2"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["seat_price", "outcome_price", "setup_usd", "sso", "complete_export", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}, "pilot": {"type": "object", "properties": {"simple_resolved": {"type": "integer"}, "simple_total": {"type": "integer"}, "complex_resolved": {"type": "integer"}, "complex_total": {"type": "integer"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum